{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021152240107-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021161631\"/><p>消息指，香港01位於葵涌貨櫃碼頭路88號永得利廣場的辦公室，今日(21日)懷疑收到粉末信，職員立即報案求助。警員接報到場，並且疏散該公司的職員疏散至平台暫避，暫時未確定相關粉末有無危險性。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:20:02.145020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:22:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:45.802809+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:45.802809+00:00","content_hash":"3c68c0ffb950d196d13098a31214a9caa3a70b659f459e85aaf8c2f212915624","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}